OL,3,GNEWSAThe DIY Dalek raising funds for
OL,4,Acancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired carpenter and Doctor Who
OL,7,Ffanatic has created a full-sized Dalek
OL,8,Fto support life-saving cancer research.
OL,10,FMartin Williams, from east Leeds, was
OL,11,Ftold to head straight to A&E after his
OL,12,Fkidneys stopped functioning properly
OL,13,Fdue to an enlarged prostate. Further
OL,14,Finvestigations revealed he had advanced
OL,15,Fprostate cancer.
OL,17,FDiagnosed in 2020, the 73-year-old
OL,18,Fdecided to put his passion for woodwork
OL,19,Fto create something truly
OL,20,Fout-of-this-world and help raise funds
OL,21,Ffor Yorkshire Cancer Research.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
