OL,3,GNEWSAThe DIY Dalek raising funds for
OL,4,Acancer research
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was proud the creation, due
OL,7,Fto be sold at auction, "will help fund
OL,8,Fresearch that saves lives in
OL,9,FYorkshire".
